      credit risk strengthening, and operational improvement.
    </p>

    <ul class="bullets">
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Family Bank</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Commercial Banking Institutions</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Executive Credit Teams</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Risk Management Departments</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- SACCO Sector -->
  <div class="mini-panel reveal">
    <div class="mini-title">SACCO Movement</div>

    <p class="mini-note">
      Strengthening governance, credit administration,
      collections, recovery, and institutional capability
      across the SACCO sector.
    </p>

    <ul class="bullets">
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Stima SACCO</li>
