      <li><span class="dot"></span>Non-Deposit SACCOs</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Executive Leadership Teams</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Government -->
  <div class="mini-panel reveal">
    <div class="mini-title">Government Institutions</div>

    <p class="mini-note">
      Capability development, governance programmes,
      institutional strengthening, and leadership support
      within the public sector.
    </p>

    <ul class="bullets">
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Kenya Revenue Authority (KRA)</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Government Agencies</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Public Sector Institutions</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>State Corporations</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Learning & Professional Development -->
  <div class="mini-panel reveal">
    <div class="mini-title">Learning & Professional Development</div>

    <p class="mini-note">
      Developing professional capability through executive
      education, faculty engagement, and accredited learning
      programmes.
    </p>

    <ul class="bullets">
      <li><span class="dot"></span>NITA</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Universities</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Corporate Academies</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Professional Associations</li>
    </ul>
