<section class="solution">

  <div class="section-inner">

    <div class="section-tag reveal">
      Selected Engagements
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-heading reveal">
      How KIPROD Supports
      <em>Institutional Transformation</em>
    </h2>

    <p class="section-sub reveal">
      Every engagement is tailored to the institution's strategic priorities.
      While no two projects are identical, our work consistently focuses on
      strengthening governance, improving capability, and delivering measurable
      operational performance.
    </p>

    <div class="solution-model">

      <div class="model-step reveal">
        <div class="model-label">01</div>
        <div class="model-title">
          Credit Risk Capability Development
        </div>
        <div class="model-desc">
          Executive workshops, professional certification programmes,
          technical training, and institutional learning initiatives.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="model-step reveal">
        <div class="model-label">02</div>
        <div class="model-title">
          Governance & Leadership Support
        </div>
        <div class="model-desc">
          Board advisory, governance reviews,
          executive visibility, accountability frameworks,
          and institutional oversight.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="model-step reveal">
        <div class="model-label">03</div>
        <div class="model-title">
          Portfolio Performance Improvement
        </div>
        <div class="model-desc">
          Credit monitoring, portfolio analysis,
          collections optimisation,
          recovery strategies,
          and operational discipline.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="model-step reveal">
        <div class="model-label">04</div>
        <div class="model-title">
          Institutional Capability Assessments
        </div>
        <div class="model-desc">
          Structured institutional reviews,
          capability benchmarking,
          maturity assessments,
          and strategic roadmaps.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="model-step reveal">
        <div class="model-label">05</div>
        <div class="model-title">
          Executive Advisory
        </div>
        <div class="model-desc">
          Supporting executive teams with strategic
          decision-making, governance reinforcement,
          and sustainable institutional growth.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="model-step reveal">
        <div class="model-label">06</div>
        <div class="model-title">
          Long-Term Institutional Partnerships
        </div>
        <div class="model-desc">
          Continuous implementation support through
          the RMS methodology and the KIPROD Command Centre.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>

